                <mxCell id="md-fi-enums" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;" value="&lt;b&gt;Tipos ENUM&lt;/b&gt; (PostgreSQL CREATE TYPE)&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;role&lt;/b&gt;: owner, coordinator, receptionist, professional, assistant&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;employment_type&lt;/b&gt;: partner_mei, clt&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;service_category&lt;/b&gt;: hair, nails, aesthetics, brows_lashes&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;hair_size&lt;/b&gt;: short, medium, long, extra_long&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;block_reason&lt;/b&gt;: medical, day_off, course, personal, other&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;time_block_status&lt;/b&gt;: pending, approved, rejected&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;client_source&lt;/b&gt;: instagram, referral, walk_in, other&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;client_note_kind&lt;/b&gt;: note, allergy&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;appointment_status&lt;/b&gt;: scheduled, confirmed, in_service, done, canceled, no_show&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;confirmation_status&lt;/b&gt;: pending, confirmed, reschedule_requested, no_answer&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ticket_status&lt;/b&gt;: open, closed, canceled&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ticket_item_kind&lt;/b&gt;: service, product, package&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;adjustment_type&lt;/b&gt;: surcharge, commercial_discount, courtesy&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;approval_status&lt;/b&gt;: pending, approved, rejected&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;payment_kind&lt;/b&gt;: cash, pix, debit, credit, credit_installments&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;tip_fee_policy&lt;/b&gt;: deduct, absorb&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;debt_status&lt;/b&gt;: open, paid&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;cash_status&lt;/b&gt;: open, closed&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;cash_movement_type&lt;/b&gt;: opening, payment, refund, withdrawal, petty_expense, advance, deposit&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;commission_kind&lt;/b&gt;: service, product, refund&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;closing_status&lt;/b&gt;: open, approved, paid&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;invoice_status&lt;/b&gt;: pending, received&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;bill_type&lt;/b&gt;: payable, receivable&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;bill_status&lt;/b&gt;: open, paid, canceled&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;product_kind&lt;/b&gt;: resale, internal&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;stock_movement_type&lt;/b&gt;: purchase, sale, adjustment&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;special_date_kind&lt;/b&gt;: holiday, closed, peak&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;recurrence_type&lt;/b&gt;: daily, weekly, monthly&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;task_status&lt;/b&gt;: open, done&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;notification_type&lt;/b&gt;: check_in, approval_request, block_request, task, bill_due, refund&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;audit_action&lt;/b&gt;: insert, update, cancel, refund, login, export&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;job_status&lt;/b&gt;: running, success, failed" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="455" width="820" x="70" y="4300" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="md-fi-convencoes" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;" value="&lt;b&gt;Convenções&lt;/b&gt; (Flask + SQLAlchemy/Alembic, PostgreSQL)&lt;hr&gt;Nomes em inglês, singular, snake_case. PK id serial (bigserial nos logs).&lt;br&gt;naming_convention do MetaData:&lt;br&gt;pk: pk_%(table_name)s&lt;br&gt;fk: fk_%(table_name)s_%(column_0_name)s_%(referred_table_name)s&lt;br&gt;uq: uq_%(table_name)s_%(column_0_name)s&lt;br&gt;ix: ix_%(column_0_label)s&lt;br&gt;ck: ck_%(table_name)s_%(constraint_name)s&lt;br&gt;ON DELETE padrão RESTRICT (não escrito); CASCADE só em filhos sem valor próprio.&lt;br&gt;ENUMs como tipos nativos do PostgreSQL (sqlalchemy.Enum, native_enum=True).&lt;br&gt;Exclusão lógica: active = false; dinheiro nunca é apagado (estorno).&lt;br&gt;Regras com vigência (valid_from): vale a linha mais recente ≤ data do atendimento.&lt;br&gt;&quot;user&quot; é palavra reservada: o ORM coloca entre aspas.&lt;br&gt;unit_id em quase todas as tabelas (multi-unidade)." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="234" width="820" x="930" y="4300" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="md-fi-m4-ref-ra" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontStyle=2;fontSize=10;dashed=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#555555;" value="staff&lt;br&gt;(módulo 2)" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="50" width="395" x="3485" y="1168" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
